OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #100,000 over boat
OL,4,Aengineer death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firm has been fined #100,000 over the
OL,7,Fdeath of an apprentice engineer who
OL,8,Finhaled toxic fire extinguisher spray
OL,9,Fin the engine room of a fishing boat.
OL,11,FConor Moseley, 20, died on board the
OL,12,FResurgam on 15 November 2019 while it
OL,13,Fwas moored in Newlyn, Cornwall.
OL,15,FTruro Crown Court heard about six
OL,16,Fpeople were working in the room at the
OL,17,Ftime, which only had a single exit up a
OL,18,Fladder as the room filled with the fire
OL,19,Fextinguishing aerosol.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
