OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #100,000 over boat
OL,4,Aengineer death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard there were failings
OL,7,Fwhich included no evacuation plan or
OL,8,Fsufficient leadership. Stevenson and
OL,9,FSons admitted two health and safety
OL,10,Fbreaches.
